// LEGO MINDSTORMS EV3 (AM1808) executable post-EEPROM baseline.
// The AM1808 CPU, RAM, clock/power/pinmux controls, interrupt controller,
// Timer64 and debug UART are functional. platforms/cpus/am1808.repl explicitly
// selects the deterministic post-bootloader constructor preset because no
// proprietary boot ROM or EEPROM image is executed or distributed.
// LCD, GPIO, ADC/SPI motor/sensor front ends and PRU are intentionally not
// claimed until their models are connected.

using "platforms/cpus/am1808.repl"
